.loopster(1) -- Virtual Volume Manager Shell Script

NAME
       loopster 

SYNOPSIS
       loopster [options]

DESCRIPTION
       a wrapper around commands to make them politely run in a loop till a test passes 

OPTIONS
       -h, --help          Show this help message and exit.
       -v, --version       Show version information and exit.
       -t, --test          Set the command to be tested
       -l, --loop          Set the worker command to be looped
       -c, --count         Set the maximum loops to be looped (defaults to 33)
       -v, --verbose       Increase verbosity (can be used more than once -vvvvv)
       --verbosity         Set Verbosity (defaults to 0)

USAGE

       


